#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid ""
"The Ruger LCR (Lightweight Compact Revolver) is a modern revolver, starting "
"production in just 2010.  It's a lightweight, aluminum-framed revolver, "
"designed for conceal carry with its double-action-only trigger, lightweight "
"and compact size.  Due to the double-action trigger, it is more possible to "
"carry it in your pocket instead of a holster due to the heavy trigger, but "
"still ill-advised."
msgstr ""
"Ruger LCR (Lightweight Compact Revolver) to nowoczesny rewolwer, produkowany "
"dopiero od 2010 roku. Jest to lekki rewolwer z aluminiowym szkieletem, "
"zaprojektowany do ukrytego noszenia, ze spustem wyłącznie z samonapinaniem "
"oraz lekką i kompaktową budową. Dzięki ciężko chodzącemu spustowi z "
"samonapinaniem łatwiej nosić go w kieszeni zamiast w kaburze, choć wciąż jest"
" to niewskazane."

