#. ~ Description of gun "UMP submachine gun"
#. ~ Description of "UMP submachine gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/45.json
msgid ""
"A modern polymer-body sub-machine gun, once quite popular with police "
"departments until recently.  Can be configured in 9x19mm, .40 S&W, or .45 ACP"
" using conversion kits and the appropriate UMP magazine."
msgstr ""
"Nowoczesny pistolet maszynowy z polimerowym korpusem, do niedawna dość "
"popularny w policji. Za pomocą zestawów do zmiany kalibru i odpowiedniego "
"magazynka UMP można go skonfigurować w kalibrze 9 x 19 mm, .40 S&W lub .45 "
"ACP."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "UMP submachine gun"
